Package: enrollr
Title: Toy Clinical Enrollment Helpers for Learning GitHub Actions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Garcia", email = "michaelbgarcia@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A deliberately small package of subject-enrollment helpers used as
    the test subject for a hands-on GitHub Actions course. Every function here
    exists to give testthat something meaningful to assert against, and to give
    CI something meaningful to break.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.2.0),
    covr,
    shiny,
    shinytest2,
    lintr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
